{"seq":2,"slug":"food-safety-science","title":"食品安全科学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science","introMarkdown":"# 食品安全科学 简介\n\n食品安全科学是一门以保护公众健康为核心目标的综合性学科，融合了微生物学、毒理学、化学分析和公共卫生管理等多个知识领域。随着全球食品供应链日益复杂、新型食品加工技术不断涌现，系统掌握食品安全的科学原理和管理方法已成为相关领域从业者的必备素养。\n\n本课程从危害识别、控制体系、检测技术和法规治理四个维度出发，构建食品安全的完整知识体系。\n\n第一章**食品安全危害分析**系统梳理食品中的三类主要危害因素，包括致病微生物和寄生虫等生物性危害、农药残留与重金属等化学性污染物，以及异物混入等物理性危害的来源、危害机理和典型案例。\n\n第二章**食品安全控制体系**重点讲解现代食品安全管理的制度框架，涵盖HACCP体系的原理与实施、良好生产规范（GMP）的标准要求，以及从农田到餐桌的食品追溯体系的设计与运行。\n\n第三章**食品安全检测技术**聚焦于危害因子的发现和鉴定手段，从快速检测方法的原理与应用场景，到分子诊断技术在食品安全中的新进展，再到智能传感器在实时监测中的前沿探索。\n\n第四章**食品安全法规与治理**从制度和政策层面审视食品安全的保障机制，分析我国食品安全法律法规的体系架构、国际食品安全标准的比较与对接，以及风险交流在食品安全治理中的关键作用。\n\n建议学习者在具备基础化学和微生物学知识后，按照\"识别危害—建立控制—检测验证—制度保障\"的逻辑顺序推进学习，这样能够更好地理解食品安全管理的系统思维和实践路径。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hazards","title":"食品安全危害分析","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/hazards","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"biological-hazards","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 生物性危害","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/hazards/biological-hazards"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chemical-contaminants","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 化学性污染物","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/hazards/chemical-contaminants"},{"seq":3,"slug":"physical-hazards","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 物理性危害","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/hazards/physical-hazards"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"control-systems","title":"食品安全控制体系","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/control-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"haccp-system","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — HACCP体系","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/control-systems/haccp-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gmp-standards","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — GMP标准","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/control-systems/gmp-standards"},{"seq":3,"slug":"traceability-systems","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 食品追溯体系","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/control-systems/traceability-systems"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"detection","title":"食品安全检测技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/detection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rapid-detection-methods","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 快速检测方法","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/detection/rapid-detection-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"molecular-diagnostics-food","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 食品分子诊断技术","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/detection/molecular-diagnostics-food"},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-sensors","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 智能传感技术","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/detection/smart-sensors"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"regulation","title":"食品安全法规与治理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/regulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"food-safety-law","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 食品安全法律法规","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/regulation/food-safety-law"},{"seq":2,"slug":"international-standards","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 国际食品安全标准","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/regulation/international-standards"},{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-communication","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — 风险交流","url":"/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/regulation/risk-communication"}]}]}